    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautiful stone-built, two-bedroom cottage with a studio apartment plus a large garage on a 1.8 acre plot. Located in a very scenic area between Glenties Town (5km) and Fintown (8km). This fabulous property comes to the market in pristine condition. Internal accommodation comprises of kitchen/living room, two double bedrooms and a shower room. The studio apartment was originally the old cow byre and has now been converted into an en-suite bedroom. Set on an elevated site with commanding rural views. Seldom does a cottage in such original and good walk-in condition come to the market. Early viewing is strongly recommended with all enquiries welcome."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Two bedroom cottage plus studio apartment.<br><br>\nKitchen/Living Room - 5.4m x 3.8m <br>High and low level pine kitchen units. \nStainless steel sink.\nGas cooker - included. \nLow level fridge - included. \nWashing machine - included. \nGlass fronted solid fuel stove. \nChinese slate flooring. \nDual aspect windows. \nVelux window. \nPart loft storage area above kitchen area. \nPine ceiling (part vaulted). <br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4m x 3.8m <br>Dual aspect windows. \nPine ceiling (part vaulted). \nDual aspect windows. \nTimber floor. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.8m x 3m <br>Front facing window. \nPine ceiling (part vaulted). \nTimber floor. <br><br><br>\nShower Room - 2m x 1.8m Max. Measurement <br>WC, WHB and electric shower. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nVelux window. \nMirror and light over WHB. <br><br><br>\nStudio Apartment - 4.5m x 3.6m <br>The old cow byre converted. \nOne en-suite bedroom. \nPedestrian door. \nGable window. \nVelux window in bedroom. \nVaulted pine ceiling. \nLinoleum flooring in bedroom. \n\nEn-Suite:\nWC, WHB and electric shower. \nFloor and walls fully tiled. \nVelux window. <br><br><br>\nGarage - 8m x 4.7m <br>Block cavity walls. \nStone-faced on one side. \nConcrete floor. \nSlate roofed. \nVehicle roller door. \nPedestrian door. \nWindow. \nVelux window. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Original cottage and studio are stone-built. \nOil fired central heating to both.\nLarge modern garage. \n1.8 acre plot. \nCottage in elevated setting with expansive rural views. \nConnected to mains water. \nSeptic tank within site boundary."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
    ],
